8	// regardless of the order the rows were created or seeded. A project with no notes shows an empty
9	// state (project-notes-empty). A form (note-form) writes a new note: type the text into note-form-text
10	// and submit it with note-form-submit — the note then appears in the list, and because it is the
11	// newest it appears first.
